Solution: Separate into distinct columns:


::: {.cell layout-align="center"}

```{.r .cell-code}
tidy_rates <- messy_rates |>
  separate(rate, into = c("cases", "population"), sep = "/", convert = TRUE)

tidy_rates |> gt()
```

